4	// network between them. `msgs` is the in-flight multiset, kept sorted, each
5	// message encoded as 'Assign:<task>', 'Abort:<task>' or 'Report:<task>:<outcome>'.
6	// Delivery of any in-flight message is an environment action, so the checker
7	// explores every arrival order.
